<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 103,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 103,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Tuesday were 103,000 head, compared with the estimate of 100,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady to $0.50 per cwt lower than the midsession Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.00 -58.00	   58.00 -59.00</p>
<p>few				 56.50		    57.50</p>
<p>Sows:  generally steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.50 -44.00	   42.50 -45.50</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.50 -46.50	   42.50 -46.50</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -49.00	   45.00 -50.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
